      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:birkhot_hashachar/gomel_chasadim">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/gomel_chasadim/1"/>וּתְ֒נֵֽנוּ הַיּוֹם וּבְ֒כָל יוֹם
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/gomel_chasadim/2"/>לְחֵן וּלְחֶֽסֶד וּלְ֒רַחֲמִים
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/gomel_chasadim/3"/>בְּעֵינֶֽיךָ
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/gomel_chasadim/4"/>וּבְ֒עֵינֵי כָל רוֹאֵֽינוּ
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/gomel_chasadim/5"/>וְתִגְמְ֒לֵֽנוּ חֲסָדִים טוֹבִים:
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/gomel_chasadim/6"/>בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/gomel_chasadim/7"/>הַגּוֹמֵל חֲסָדִים טוֹבִים
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/gomel_chasadim/8"/>לְעַמּוֹ יִשְׂרָאֵל:</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
